14534856,2025-07-08,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Investigation took more than 30 days,"I am filing this formal complaint against Experian, a nationwide consumer reporting agency, for continuing to report inaccurate, unverifiable, and harmful information on my credit report even after I submitted a proper dispute. This is my second attempt, and Experian has failed to investigate or correct the errors within the time frame required by law under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). 
