14559133,2025-07-09,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Getting a loan or lease,Confusing or misleading advertising or marketing,"I was on XXXX XXXX and saw that I was pre-qualified to refinance my current auto loan at a 4 % interest rate with autopay. I hadnt even completed the application I realized my phone number had a typo and I wasnt able to finish the process because of that. 

