If the late payment can not be verified, instruct the creditor to update my account status to "" Paid As Agreed, Never Late. '' Notify Equifax, Experian and TransUnion to reflect the corrected information on my credit report.

Provide a detailed description of the investigation process used to verify this account, as required by law.

Final Notice : Failure to properly investigate and correct this inaccurate information may result in further actions, including potential escalation to legal authorities for non-compliance with federal consumer protection laws.

I have enclosed copies of all supporting documents related to this dispute. Please acknowledge receipt of this complaint and provide a written update within the legally mandated timeframe. 
Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I look forward to your response. 
Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",FL,33615,,Web,2025-07-10,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes
