iv. Failing to address coercion, misrepresentation, and potential collusion by PAL and XXXX XXXX. I seek full restitution of the {$240.00} charge and an apology from Capital One for their unfair handling of my dispute. 

For PAL and XXXX XXXX coercive and exploitative practices, I am filing a separate complaint with the U.S. Department of Transportation against PAL. However, I request the CFPB consider their actions as context for Capital Ones failure to recognize the charges deceptive nature.

