14625796,2025-07-13,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"RE : Account Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX Amount : {$770.00} Subject : Formal Dispute and Demand for Deletion of Charge-Off Accounts Pursuant to 15 U.S.C. 1681e & 1681i This serves as a formal dispute and demand for the immediate deletion of all charge-off accounts currently appearing on my credit report. I am asserting my rights under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), specifically : 15 U.S. Code 1681e which requires that consumer reporting agencies maintain procedures to ensure maximum possible accuracy of the information reported ; and 15 U.S. Code 1681i which requires consumer reporting agencies to conduct a reasonable reinvestigation of any information disputed by the consumer and to delete or correct any unverifiable, inaccurate, or incomplete information. 
