14635001,2025-07-14,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Personal information incorrect,"On XX/XX/XXXX, I submitted a formal complaint requesting the deletion of outdated and unverifiable personal information from my credit report, including former addresses, old phone numbers, previous employer entries, and the visibility of my full Social Security number and date of birth. This request was based on FCRA 1681 ( a ) ( 4 ), which outlines my right to privacy and demands accurate, complete, and verifiable information in credit reports. 

