14676544,2025-07-17,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"Summary of Complaint : I am filing this complaint against TransUnion LLC for willfully and negligently reporting inaccurate, unverifiable, and outdated information on my credit report in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ). I formally disputed these accounts directly with TransUnion, but they either failed to conduct a reasonable reinvestigation or allowed incorrect and damaging data to remain. Below are the details of each violation : XXXX. Wrong Address Reporting ( Violation of FCRA 1681e ( b ) ) XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/XXXXXXXX I have never lived here. This address is not associated with me. 

