I have also requested copies of any contracts related to these accounts from the company reporting them, and after more than 60 days, I have not received a single response. This further supports the fact that there is no verifiable evidence or legal basis for continuing to report this information. 

I respectfully request that you assist me by removing these accounts immediately.",,"EQUIFAX, INC.",FL,34741,,Web,2025-07-16,Closed with explanation,Yes
